go 1.25.0

// Local dev bridge: the stubSwarmNode in node/lad_reach_bridge_ingest_test.go
// implements swarm.Node with SetPartition, which the swarm release loom/go.mod
// pins does not declare; it exists only in the unpublished ../swarm working
// tree. Resolve swarm locally until it is published and loom bumps its pin.
// Consumers replace loom and swarm in their own go.work.
use .
use ../swarm

// Local dev bridge: loom/go.mod pins an aether release that lacks the
// AuthenticatedPrincipal Subject, Partition and opaque ScopeAxis Axes fields
// pkg/dispatch sends and node/rpc.go reads, and the NoiseTransportConfig
// PartitionKeyResolver core/transport/manager sets; both exist only in the
// unpublished ../aether working tree. Resolve aether locally until they are
// published and loom bumps its pin.
use ../aether

// Local dev bridge: loom/go.mod pins ledger and reach releases, but
// the directory code reads ledger.Record.Partition and calls
// storage.RequirePartitionColumn, which exist only in the unpublished
// ../ledger working tree. reach is resolved locally with it because the
// published reach does not compile against the local ledger's Record.
// Resolve both locally until they are published and loom bumps its pins.
use ../ledger

use ../reach

// loom/go.mod pins a tursoraft release, but node/meshdb_transport.go implements
// tursoraft's mesh.Mesh contract and node/runtime.go passes it as
// ManagerConfig.Mesh; both exist only in the unpublished ../tursoraft
// working tree. tursoraft resolves go-libsql and policypool through its own
// go.mod replaces. Resolve it locally until it is published and loom bumps
// its pin.
use ../tursoraft
